{'symbol': 'APA', 'date': '2023-02-14 16:43:00', 'title': "APA CORPORATION NAMED ONE OF WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES BY FORTUNE MAGAZINE", 'text': "HOUSTON, FEB. 14, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- APA CORPORATION (NASDAQ: APA) HAS BEEN NAMED BY FORTUNE MAGAZINE AS ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES FOR A FIFTH TIME. APA RANKED FIFTH THIS YEAR AMONG INTERNATIONAL ENERGY EXPLORATION COMPANIES."}